## Not yet checked in the game {% #live-check %}

The transfer request was captured in the game for Berimond only. Transfers between the Great Empire and the other kingdoms come from another bot's code. Check one small transfer on a spare account before you rely on it. The game's answer to a second transfer into a busy kingdom has never been seen either.

## Related errors {% #errors %}

- [PLUGIN_OPTION_ROW](/errors/#plugin-option-row): a row of a table is not complete.
- [PLUGIN_OPTION_ITEM](/errors/#plugin-option-item): a row names a troop or tool that isn't in the list.
- [PLUGIN_OPTION_ROWS](/errors/#plugin-option-rows): a table has too many rows.
